The '''Plasma Nucleus''' is a {{Legendary}} item.

== Obtaining ==
=== Dark Auction ===
The '''Plasma Nucleus''' has a chance to be auctioned during the [[Dark Auction]] with a starting bid of {{c|20000000}} while [[Scorpius]] is elected as mayor with his {{AN|Darker Auctions}} perk.

=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Plasma Nucleus''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

